    <subfield code="a">"In establishing shots and close-up views, a series of daytime photographs show a generic European housing complex. Signs of life like laundry lines with fresh wash appear, even though not a single soul makes an appearance. The stillness edges towards unquietness through signs of a military presence in mini-fleet of camouflaged jeeps and trucks as well as flowers lain in memorial before a statue of an archer." Printed Matter.</subfield>
